%%%
A written Bernoulli regression law Bernoulli.(invlogit.(alpha .+ x * beta)) is the §09 BernoulliLogitGLM. §09 requires finite
coefficients, so an infinite coefficient is outside the law's declared value set.
%%%
flatppl_compat = "0.1"
x = elementof(cartpow(reals, [3, 2]))
alpha = elementof(reals)
beta = elementof(cartpow(reals, 2))
